{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming","id":28801,"title":"When is the Translation Guide coming?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-12T10:21:55-08:00","id":28801,"title":"When is the Translation Guide coming?","content":"With the Kickstarter safely wrapped up, I found it a little funny when the Translation Guide never got mentioned. Any clue when it's coming along?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T10:56:32-08:00","id":28817,"title":"","content":"I know they traded the work they were going to do for the Translation Guide for the Quickstart. Now with the focus on getting Descent, It should at least be a month before focuses change. I imagine we might still get it quick, but that means maybe around Spring.<br /> <br /> I wouldn't know though, I'm just spitballing. I leave it to Rose and Matt to tell us the truth.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T11:12:35-08:00","id":28825,"title":"","content":"Rose is writing it, I'm developing it. Some schedule hiccups in personal lives and in <b>Demon </b>kinda delayed it, coupled with the fact that it's not an easy project just because of the differences between the games. It's on the schedule, don't worry, but I don't know any firm dates at this point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T14:36:42-08:00","id":28934,"title":"","content":"Because the games are so different, I'm really looking forward to seeing how you and Rose solve some of the thematic and mechanical incompatibilities. <br /> To be honest, though, I'm looking forward to just about every upcoming Demon book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-curse-2e-conversion\" target=\"_blank\">Lightweight 2E Conversion</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/22378-second-sight-tradition-disciples-of-duat\" target=\"_blank\">Disciples of Duat</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/61-octavo","name":"Octavo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar61_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T05:14:18-08:00","id":29254,"title":"","content":"I really wanna grab a copy of all of the Translation guides. Even though I'm not a big Vamp or Wolf player, I still think they'd be a blast to read through, and I think incorporating the Technocracy into NWoD sounds amazing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1009-kristastic","name":"Kristastic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1009_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T09:02:56-08:00","id":29350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kristastic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=29254#post29254\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really wanna grab a copy of all of the Translation guides. Even though I'm not a big Vamp or Wolf player, I still think they'd be a blast to read through, and I think incorporating the Technocracy into NWoD sounds amazing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds awesome to me too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T12:06:54-08:00","id":29448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Octavo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=28934#post28934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because the games are so different, I'm really looking forward to seeing how you and Rose solve some of the thematic and mechanical incompatibilities.<br /> To be honest, though, I'm looking forward to just about every upcoming Demon book. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I was actually thinking that it seems strange, given how different the games are, to even do a translation guide. Now I'm really curious!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1459-robotdjuret","name":"RobotDjuret","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T12:09:20-08:00","id":29453,"title":"","content":"To be fair, I've been able to convert two Fallen characters over into Descent characters pretty easily without the translation guide. The groundwork is there, mechanically speaking-there's quite a few nice similiarities to work off of-it's the fluff that'll be interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T16:33:12-08:00","id":29600,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s certainly doable. On the old Wiki (is it archived somewhere, or is it just gone for now?), I did a proof-of-concept partial Translation Guide for Changeling; if <i>those</i> two games can be translated, then translating Demon is doable. <br /> <br /> The trick is to remember that a Translation Guide involves taking bits and pieces of game X that you like and showing how they can be incorporated into game Y; the goal isn\u2019t a complete translation of everything you\u2019ll find in X into Y all at once \u2014 if you like everything about X, why aren\u2019t you just playing X? <br /> <br /> So break <b>Fallen</b> into its component parts, look at them one at a time, and ask yourself \u201chow would I fit this into <b>Descent</b>?\u201d Then break <b>Descent</b> into its component parts, look at them one at a time, and ask \u201chow would I fit this into <b>Fallen</b>?\u201d<br /> <br /> My favorite part of the Translation Guides, though, is the compare-and-contrast, where the writer isn\u2019t translating, but merely holding both games up side by side and saying \u201cthis is where they\u2019re similar, and this is where they differ\u201d \u2014 I learned a lot about <b>Awakening</b> by reading the <b>Mage Translation Guide</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T17:41:12-08:00","id":29633,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=29600#post29600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> ...the goal isn\u2019t a complete translation of everything you\u2019ll find in X into Y all at once</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly right, sir, although sometimes I can see the reasoning. For instance, I <b>greatly</b> prefer NWoD's system to CWoD, but <b>M:tAsc</b>'s traditions were pretty cool. So was the Technocracy. Might be nifty to shift all of that into NWoD. Anyway, yeah, you're definitely correct. That's why I like what I've seen about transplanting the Technocracy into NWoD: you've gotta find a way to make them fit the new cosmology. You can't just plunk 'em in.<br /> <br /> I think it'll be interesting to see what the Translation guide will discuss for transplanting the more Judeo-Christian themes of <b>Fallen </b>into <b>Descent</b>. I do enjoy me some Judeo-Christian dogma when it comes to gaming.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1009-kristastic","name":"Kristastic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1009_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-13T23:13:31-08:00","id":29766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=29600#post29600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">if you like everything about X, why aren\u2019t you just playing X?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've never Demon the Fallen, but I've seen this kind of pop up in other places and I think it is a very bad attitude to have. At the very least such a person might not like the mechanics of the old game, but not like the setting/theme of the new game. Heck, the person running the conversion could just not have a group willing to work with the old system. To those people it sounds entirely dismissive of them.<br /> <br /> More on topic, I am interested in this conversion guide because Demon the Fallen does sound like a better fit for my interests than what we have. Most of the Demon concepts that I have attempted to build just are not possible with what we have in Demon the Descent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T10:51:27-08:00","id":29991,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=29766#post29766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've never Demon the Fallen, but I've seen this kind of pop up in other places and I think it is a very bad attitude to have. At the very least such a person might not like the mechanics of the old game, but not like the setting/theme of the new game. Heck, the person running the conversion could just not have a group willing to work with the old system. To those people it sounds entirely dismissive of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah; but then you don\u2019t like everything about X: you don\u2019t like its rules. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> More seriously: once you\u2019ve chopped X into bite-sized pieces and run each chunk through the Translation Guide, you can make Y as much like X as you\u2019d like \u2014 including turning it into a clone of X, if that\u2019s what you want to do. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=29766#post29766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More on topic, I am interested in this conversion guide because Demon the Fallen does sound like a better fit for my interests than what we have. Most of the Demon concepts that I have attempted to build just are not possible with what we have in Demon the Descent.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah; me too. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T11:02:39-08:00","id":29998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hark</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=29766#post29766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">More on topic, I am interested in this conversion guide because Demon the Fallen does sound like a better fit for my interests than what we have. Most of the Demon concepts that I have attempted to build just are not possible with what we have in Demon the Descent.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm curious what concepts you have that aren't possible with <b>Descent</b>. Could you perhaps share? (If that's off-topic, and it might be, PM is fine.)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/552-strider1276","name":"strider1276","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar552_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"382"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T11:59:03-08:00","id":30022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=29991#post29991\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah; but then you don\u2019t like everything about X: you don\u2019t like its rules. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> More seriously: once you\u2019ve chopped X into bite-sized pieces and run each chunk through the Translation Guide, you can make Y as much like X as you\u2019d like \u2014 including turning it into a clone of X, if that\u2019s what you want to do.<br /> <br /> Yeah; me too.</div> </div> </div> </div>Touch\u00e9 all around, sir!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>strider1276</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious what concepts you have that aren't possible with <b>Descent</b>. Could you perhaps share? (If that's off-topic, and it might be, PM is fine.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I dare say that's pretty on-topic; I'm not positive, but it is helping discuss the translation of <b>D:tF </b>to <b>D:tD</b> and vice-versa. The original topic has already kind of been discussed, but these are all related.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":1009,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1009-kristastic","user":"Kristastic","date":".  Me no understand board code 12-14-2013, 02:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1009-kristastic","name":"Kristastic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1009_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T13:47:54-08:00","id":30089,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'm loving the Translation Guides too. It's nice to port things I loved in the oWoD into the nWoD (and vice versa), and I occasionally find interesting ideas in them that I had not considered before. I just wish we also would have gotten one for Changeling, Mummy, Hunter, etc.<br /> <br /> Anyway, while the setting, themes and even mechanics of Demon: the Fallen and Demon: the Descent are quite different, there are enough similarities there that I can sort of see how it would work. Especially after reading the preview pdf. One thing that especially jumped out at me early on is how the four Agendas correspond quite nicely with four of the five Factions, albeit modified for flavor and setting. Only the Luciferians are left out, mostly because their entire raison d'\u00eatre no longer makes sense in Descent. No Lucifer after all. On the other hand, the Saboteurs offer a more PC friendly version of the Raveners*.<br /> <br /> Interestingly, it seems to me the differences between Incarnations and Houses are more nuanced. Some are more obvious than others; the Halaku easily equate with Psychopomps and/or Destroyers. But while the Annunaki might conceptually have more in common with Psychopomps, it would be easier to represent them with Guardians thanks to Instrumental Embeds working with ones tools and surroundings. And of course ANY Demon can become proficient in creating Gadgets. Similarly, before the game came out, I expected Destroyers to map closest to Rabisu (and indeed, Cacophony Embeds feature healing as well as combat effects, which goes nicely for the Lore of the Flesh) but as I read through the preview pdf, I couldn't help but realize how cool the idea of Messengers revealing messages to animals was (via Embeds like Animal Communication). I felt I could easily translate one of my old Devourer characters as a Messenger who revealed things to animals, trees and even bacteria!<br /> <br /> Honestly, adding a Christian flavour doesn't strike me as THAT difficult, if only because so much of it is fluff and setting more than mechanics. Simply swap out &quot;the God-Machine&quot; for God (which happens several times in the pdf by the way) and maybe stipulate that Demons didn't appear on earth until the Reckoning if you want to keep the metaplot. Even the Earthbound aren't that hard to incorporate. The biggest conceptual differences I can see are between Lores and Embeds. Aside from the obvious problem of Lores being progressions while Embeds are singular powers, Lores are extremely flashy and vulgar, while Embeds are subtle. Even the more overt Exploits don't approach what Lores can do. Certainly, as I said above, there are at least some points of overlap there. Rip the Gates goes nicely with the Lore of Paths, while Like I Built It and Right Tools, Right Job at least cover the more basic levels of the Lore of the Forge. But other Lores like the Lore of Storms don't have many cognates.<br /> <br /> * Note that these are just shallow, cursory looks at the Agendas and Factions. In truth, there are multiple points of similarity. The Raveners can be represented by both Saboteurs AND Tempters, while the Luciferians have some conceptual overlap with the Saboteurs as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1449-zakariya-ali-sher","name":"Zakariya Ali Sher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T15:05:28-08:00","id":30112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kristastic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=29633#post29633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Exactly right, sir, although sometimes I can see the reasoning. For instance, I <b>greatly</b> prefer NWoD's system to CWoD, but <b>M:tAsc</b>'s traditions were pretty cool. So was the Technocracy.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking of the Technocracy... it might be kind of fun to drop the God Machine into the mix in a M:tAs game. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1459-robotdjuret","name":"RobotDjuret","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1459_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-14T15:49:22-08:00","id":30132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>RobotDjuret</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=30112#post30112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of the Technocracy... it might be kind of fun to drop the God Machine into the mix in a M:tAs game.</div> </div> </div> </div>*ahem* Autochthonia *ahem*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1449-zakariya-ali-sher","name":"Zakariya Ali Sher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-15T04:42:49-08:00","id":30376,"title":"","content":"Technocracy would thematically work well in a God Machine game. Especially if they had no idea they were pawns.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1009-kristastic","name":"Kristastic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1009_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"27"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-15T17:58:14-08:00","id":30659,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kristastic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/28801-when-is-the-translation-guide-coming?p=30376#post30376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Technocracy would thematically work well in a God Machine game. Especially if they had no idea they were pawns.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, I've been quiet about this too long, thinking it'd be ironic and funny if I played stupid, but you're too close for me to keep from saying this:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/7826-technocracy-in-awakening-changing-paradigms\">We think the same.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-26T19:46:29-08:00","id":58478,"title":"","content":"Was just wondering how this is going.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-04T11:20:55-08:00","id":65003,"title":"","content":"It has at least been postboned to march (just looked at the new schedule)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T23:55:29-08:00","id":73585,"title":"","content":"Any word on this?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-13T12:46:32-07:00","id":90388,"title":"","content":"Update:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt McFarland</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">First, the <b>Demon</b><b> Translation Guide</b>. I actually don\u2019t have much to say about this one, yet, just that I\u2019m developing it, Rose is writing it, and it kind of got put off because we decided getting all our demonic ducks in a row for <b>Descent</b> (Demonic Ducks Descending \u2014 new novel by Jeff Linsday?) before diving into that project. But it\u2019s on the radar, we promise. I\u2019m looking forward to it \u2013 I haven\u2019t actually done much with <b>Demon: The Fallen</b> for a while (but back in the day, I ran it and it was one of my favorite chronicles).</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--p