ent":"Are there any updates there? The schedule still says march and if I look at the number 2 / 5 below the entry I dont believe that that will work out (I think it would be good if the schedule gets an update there or some is posted here).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T10:46:41-07:00","id":102776,"title":"","content":"I don't think the schedule is up to date, unfortunately. It seems like the guide is still a fair bit off as Rose recently mentioned she had only just started writing it, if I am not mistaken...<br /> <br /> Edit: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/91448-in-case-you-missed-the-anouncement-about-the-progress-of-the-demon-books?p=99236#post99236\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...9236#post99236</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2108,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2108-genesis","user":"genesis","date":".  Added link 03-31-2014, 01:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2108-genesis","name":"genesis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-31T11:31:59-07:00","id":102803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>genesis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/